                    "ink": "purple"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Outage walk-through?** Alert, severity, commander, mitigate, communicate, postmortem",
                "**New service SLO?** Pick a user-facing SLI, set the target from baseline, review",
                "**Dashboard?** Four golden signals plus SLO burn"
